{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":38.220001220703125,"text":"In the courtyard lies an enormous bearded marble man, a river god or oceanus, from the first century AD. He was found with a basin inscribed Mare in Foro, sea in the forum, and that is where his name comes from. In the 16th and 17th centuries, Romans did not dare criticize their rulers out loud, so they wrote mocking verses on scraps of paper and pinned them to statues at night. Marforio was one of these talking statues, and he often answered another one, Pasquino. He has been a fountain since 1592 and has lived in this courtyard since 1645.","words":[{"word":"In","start":0,"end":0.3799999952316284},{"word":"the","start":0.3799999952316284,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"courtyard","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"lies","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.5},{"word":"an","start":1.5,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"enormous","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":2.359999895095825},{"word":"bearded","start":2.359999895095825,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"marble","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.380000114440918},{"word":"man","start":3.380000114440918,"end":3.819999933242798},{"word":"a","start":4.260000228881836,"end":4.380000114440918},{"word":"river","start":4.380000114440918,"end":4.559999942779541},{"word":"god","start":4.559999942779541,"end":4.840000152587891},{"word":"or","start":4.840000152587891,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"oceanus","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.900000095367432},{"word":"from","start":6.260000228881836,"end":6.380000114440918},{"word":"the","start":6.380000114440918,"end":6.579999923706055},{"word":"first","start":6.579999923706055,"end":6.820000171661377},{"word":"century","start":6.820000171661377,"end":7.21999979019165},{"word":"AD","start":7.21999979019165,"end":7.71999979019165},{"word":"He","start":8.34000015258789,"end":8.4399995803833},{"word":"was","start":8.4399995803833,"end":8.65999984741211},{"word":"found"